            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Howard"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This recipe comes together pretty quickly and is very good. The slices of brie were a little challenging but I bought the small round brie about 5\" in diameter, cut that in half and then cut slices. It was just enough for two sandwiches. I omitted the mustard that was optional just so we could enjoy the fresh flavors of the apple brie and bacon. I served with some grapes and chardonnay, thanks for the great recipe!"
          },
